.TH GRINTION-CONFIG 1 "November 2026" "Grintion-OS" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
grintion-config \- Unified Grintion-OS system configuration tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grintion-config
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B grintion-config
provides both an interactive terminal menu and a command-line interface for managing timezones, keyboard keymaps, system locales, hostnames, user credentials, power profiles, and runit background services.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB--tui\fR
Launch interactive dialog/ncurses configuration menu.
.TP
\fB--set-timezone\fR \fITZ\fR
Update system timezone (/etc/localtime).
.TP
\fB--set-hostname\fR \fINAME\fR
Update system hostname.
.TP
\fB--json\fR
Output current configuration state in JSON.
.SH AUTHORS
Grintion-OS Core Team.

